## ─── Elah Studio AI — Environment Variables ──────────────────────────────────
## Copy this file to .env.local (apps/web/.env.local) and fill in the values.
## Variables prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_* are safe to expose to the browser.
## All others are server-side only and NEVER sent to the client.

## ─── OpenAI (Required for live AI assistant) ──────────────────────────────────
## Get a key at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
## The app works without this — it falls back to the built-in local planner.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

## Override the model (default: gpt-4o-mini)
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

## ─── Supabase (Optional — enables auth, cloud project save, AI history) ────────
## Create a free project at https://supabase.com/dashboard
## Then go to Project Settings → API to find these values.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
## Service role key — server-side ONLY, never expose to browser
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

## ─── Optional Media APIs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
## The editor works fully without these.
## Pixabay — free stock footage search: https://pixabay.com/api/docs/
PIXABAY_API_KEY=
## Pexels — free stock photos: https://www.pexels.com/api/
PEXEL_API_KEY=
## Freesound — free audio samples: https://freesound.org/apiv2/apply/
FREESOUND_API_KEY=

## ─── Analytics (Optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_PROJECT_TOKEN=
